  exitDialoguesPassed:
    lastVerdict: 1
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - Smart move. You might actually survive the week.
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - "Good choice. I\u2019ll remember your face when the new order starts."
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - "You\u2019re learning. Too bad there\u2019s no time left to use those brains."
  exitDialoguesQuarantined:
    lastVerdict: 2
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - "You\u2019re making a very expensive mistake, officer."
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - A cell? For me? You clearly don't know who signs your paycheck.
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - "Enjoy your little box while it lasts. I\u2019ll be out before you blink."
  exitDialoguesKilled:
    lastVerdict: 3
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - You... don't have... the... courage... to...
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - "I\u2019ll see you... in... the... dirt..."
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - Even death... is... just... a... transaction...
  quarantineExitLines:
  - Enjoy this moment. It will be the last time anyone puts me in a box.
  - I have friends everywhere. This room will feel very crowded by morning.
  - Smart play. Wrong game. But smart.
  killExitLines:
  - "You have no idea\u2026 what you\u2019ve\u2026 just started\u2026"
  - "Remember my face\u2026 the men who answer to me\u2026 certainly will\u2026"
  - "Even this\u2026 is just a negotiation tactic\u2026 I\u2019ll be back at the
    table\u2026"
